WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:08.800
Make LYNX look the way you like: Options, Theme.

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:14.600
Pick a preset: Ocean, Emerald, Amber, Violet or Graphite.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.400
The knobs shift hue and brightness; each dot colours one part, like the tracks.

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:26.400
On the General page: Text size and Bold text, for easier reading.

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:32.400
Language: LYNX speaks fifteen of them. Size, bold and language apply on the next start.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:42.400
Bigger, bolder text, in your own colours.
